REMIND-MFA software
-------------------

The package downloads and invokes REMIND-MFA v0.2.0 at commit
bf95c898e0f6f363196bccb62d34e02d82e4726b. REMIND-MFA is licensed
GPL-3.0-only by its copyright holders. It is not copied into this source
