REMIND-MFA input data
---------------------

REMIND-MFA input data v1.0.0, revision
rev1.0.0_h12_1584d780_mfa, is published at
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18019915 under CC BY-SA 4.0.

The package contains one compact Parquet serialization of the annual default
input table derived from that source. The format and row
ordering were changed for package installation; the scientific values and
coordinates were not changed. This file remains licensed CC BY-SA 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The package generates a user-readable CSV from this compact source table
when a workspace is initialized. It does not distribute a second default-input
serialization.

The package also contains a compact regional 2019 waste trade share table
derived from the same REMIND-MFA input and its 2019 default output. It records
import and export mass divided by local collected waste before trade for each
H12 region, together with the source and balanced flow reference
amounts needed to interpret that ratio. The table is a pyToCE
transformation distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0; it does not replace or modify
the REMIND-MFA source data or equations.

